        "kind": "paragraph",
        "section_index": null,
        "text": "The entrance draughts in strongly. A 13m pitch with a tight take-off lands on boulders in a big rift. A squeeze down leads to a small chamber and a further squeeze down to a too tight section above a 10 - 15m drop which is draughting out. The constriction is removable with a lump hammer. Tagged."
      },
      {
        "index": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "section_index": null,
        "text": "Another hole, 5m deep and choked with blocks with no draught lies 200m northeast of 0908. Possibly fenced off? See Roy, Toby, Julie, Andy, Lank for location."
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "section_index": null,
        "text": "By January 2022, Julie and Andy had no recollection of this hole. and the exploration carried out on 6/8/1992."
      }
    ],
